    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Indicate 'Yes' if suspected or confirmed infection with the pathogen of interest if the reason (indication) for the hospital admission. Indicate 'No' if the suspected or confirmed infection with the pathogen of interest is not the reason (indication) for hospital admission.</rdfs:comment>
